{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15210280","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15210280","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1521028001:0":{"text":"やめて、やめてよ……パパに痛いことしないで！うぅっ……","source_cn":"不要，不要……你们不要伤害我爸爸！呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85516FF6DD7A826E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521028002:0":{"text":"カトー、どうしてここに！？おばさんのそばから離れるなと言ったじゃないか！","source_cn":"卡托！你怎么跑出来了？爸爸明明让你和姑姑待在一起！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BFE80B6D56CB14B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521028003:0":{"text":"うええん……パパ、ごうとうなんてしないで……ボク、おなか空いてないから、本当だから……","source_cn":"呜呜呜……爸爸，你不要抢别人的东西……卡托不饿，一点都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3061DED8CE474581","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521028004:1":{"text":"子どものためだったんですね。","source_cn":"原来你是为了孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62953F18A334234B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521028005:0":{"text":"父親と、その息子か……","source_cn":"一个父亲，还有一个儿子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90355A8A21E9B551","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521028006:0":{"text":"……そなたのしたことは許そう。\n護衛隊長、彼らに食料を少し分けてやれ。","source_cn":"好吧……我原谅你了。\\n护卫长官，把包里的食物分给他们一些。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA6ADDDDEE113DAD6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"……そなたのしたことは許そう。\n護衛隊長、彼らに食料を少し分けてやれ。","female":"……そなたのしたことは許そう。\n護衛隊長、彼らに食料を少し分けてやれ。","variant_male_record_index":"183295","variant_female_record_index":"183296","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1521028006":{"text":"……そなたのしたことは許そう。\n護衛隊長、彼らに食料を少し分けてやれ。","source_cn":"好吧……我原谅你了。\\n护卫长官，把包里的食物分给他们一些。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA6ADDDDEE113DAD6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"……そなたのしたことは許そう。\n護衛隊長、彼らに食料を少し分けてやれ。","female":"……そなたのしたことは許そう。\n護衛隊長、彼らに食料を少し分けてやれ。","variant_male_record_index":"183295","variant_female_record_index":"183296","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521028007:0":{"text":"わあ！パンだ！パンなんて、もうずーっと食べてなかったよ！","source_cn":"哇——是面包！我好久都没吃到面包了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57DEF1F23B24E19F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521028008:1":{"text":"パパ、パパも一緒に食べよう！","source_cn":"爸爸，你也一起吃——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x594D893708163A9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521028009:1":{"text":"いい子だ……パパは一口で十分だよ。","source_cn":"好孩子……爸爸只吃一口就够了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CF8ABB5A5024B3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521028010:0":{"text":"十分なわけないだろう。もう少し多めに持っていくといい。","source_cn":"这怎么行？你们多拿几个面包，把肚子填饱吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6693CD76B62D2F68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521028011:0":{"text":"わああ！本当にいいの！？","source_cn":"哇——真的可以吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70C48EA1EF63CAC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521028012:0":{"text":"カトー、はやくこちらの若様にお礼を言うんだ！","source_cn":"卡托，快说谢谢！谢谢这位好心的小公子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23859A9444872C07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521028013:0":{"text":"なっ、余を知っておるのか！？","source_cn":"等、等一下！你认识我？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66FD878E36368154","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521028014:0":{"text":"い、いえ、存じておりませんが……","source_cn":"不，我从未见过您。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE623CD53A47B7C4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521028015:0":{"text":"なら、なぜ「若様」と……？","source_cn":"那你为什么叫我“小公子”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E32E4666BA59212","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521028016:1":{"text":"こんな状況で人に食料を分けられるなんて、きっと裕福な家のお方なのでしょう。それに、召使いを二人従えているようですし、若様とお呼びするのが相応しいかと……","source_cn":"现在这种时候，能从家里拿出余粮分给我们的人肯定非富即贵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4EFB551BC9D7380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1521028016":{"text":"こんな状況で人に食料を分けられるなんて、きっと裕福な家のお方なのでしょう。それに、召使いを二人従えているようですし、若様とお呼びするのが相応しいかと……","source_cn":"现在这种时候，能从家里拿出余粮分给我们的人肯定非富即贵，更何况您身边还跟着两位仆人。只有这样称呼您才不会失礼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4EFB551BC9D7380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521028017:0":{"text":"……わたしたちは召使いじゃありません。","source_cn":"……我们不是他的仆人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F39AEA12B38CA99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1521028019:0":{"text":"え、それなら……","source_cn":"这……<key:dialog52>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA71C5CD171988A5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521028020:0":{"text":"この者たちは召使いではなく、余の護衛だ。","source_cn":"他们是我的护卫，不是仆人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CC1C7D6FE4618D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1521028021:0":{"text":"ああ、なるほど……やはり、あなたは親切で高貴な身分のお方なのですね。","source_cn":"哦哦，我果然没看错……您果然是位好心的公子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75D59D8654E40A1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1521028022:0":{"text":"わかさま……ひとつ聞いてもいい？","source_cn":"小公子……我可以问你一个问题吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7922886FF44AD2AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1521028023:0":{"text":"ああ、いいとも。","source_cn":"可以啊，你问吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39B317B0A8EA3738","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1521028024:0":{"text":"あの……りょうしゅさまに、会ったことある？","source_cn":"那个……你有没有见过领主殿下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x299BCF841CDEB298","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1521028025:0":{"text":"カトー！\n外で領主様のことを話しちゃいけないって言ったじゃないか！","source_cn":"——卡托！\\n爸爸和你说过，不许在外面议论领主的事……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21D564BCFAAA947F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1521028026:1":{"text":"申し訳ありません、息子の言うことは気にしないでください。ただの好奇心ですから……","source_cn":"抱歉……小公子，您别在意卡托说的话，他只是好奇而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BB45984EF9E07F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1521028027:1":{"text":"街で広まっているという領主様の「噂」も、まったく聞いたことがありませんし……この子にも、しっかり言い聞かせますので！","source_cn":"城里那些关于领主殿下的流言我们也没听说过……我会好好教...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C3F8E4D4A838950","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1521028028:0":{"text":"そう言うと、レクルスはカトーを連れて去って行った。どうやら息子を叱っているようだ。","source_cn":"雷古斯说完后，就匆匆拉着卡托走远，看起来像是在教训他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x867C5D35771E138C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1521028029:0":{"text":"もしかして、余だと気付かれたのか……？","source_cn":"他们是不是认出我了……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BCC9BD60EA43AF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:41:1521028029":{"text":"もしかして、余だと気付かれたのか……？","source_cn":"他们是不是认出我了……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BCC9BD60EA43AF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","doc